### Login administrativo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Criação de serviço
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Troca de óleo",
  "description": "Substituição de óleo do motor",
  "basePrice": 120.00,
  "estimatedMinutes": 40,
  "active": true
}

### Criação de peça
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Filtro de óleo",
  "sku": "FILTER-OIL-LOCAL",
  "unitPrice": 35.00,
  "quantityInStock": 10,
  "minimumStock": 2,
  "active": true
}

### Criação de OS usando dados semeados no Flyway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
    "fullName": "Maria Silva",
    "documentType": "CPF",
    "documentNumber": "529.982.247-25",
    "email": "maria@email.com",
    "phone": "31999999999"
  },
  "vehicle": {
    "plate": "ABC1D23",
    "brand": "Fiat",
    "model": "Argo",
    "manufacturingYear": 2020
  },
  "services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "partId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "diagnosticNotes": "Cliente solicitou manutenção preventiva."
}

### Aprovar orçamento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Finalizar OS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Entregar OS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consulta pública do cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/work-orders/{{workOrderCode}}/status?document=52998224725
